{"version":1,"content":"<p>日菜素來備受港人喜愛，加上款式選擇豐富，由高級矜貴廚師發辦和割烹，到實惠的居酒屋拉麵壽司等。</p><p>近日有走親民路線的和風餐廳登場，帶來傳統料理之餘，融入多國元素與創意點子，輔以時令食材，炮製出一系列驚喜和食！</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;上環：特色巧手魚</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T06:14:56.731617+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T06:00:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T06:08:17.091606+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T06:08:17.091606+00:00","content_hash":"cc22066a03ed5839ae5f9c292f9e8f41c104c2dec270bd183758fbc84da01b76","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}